* Agl_HSMFC156 LED Model Green/Yellow Bi-Colour LED
* Created by Shaun Quin 03-06-2002
*Typ Green: Vf=2.2V Vr=5V If=20mA 
*Typ Yellow LED: Vf=2.1V Vr=5V If=20mA 
*	       	    Green LED Anode
*	        	    |  Green LED Cathode
*	       	    |  |  Yellow LED Anode
*	        	    |  |  |  Yellow LED Cathode
*	       	    |  |  |  |
*           	   A1 K1 A2 K2
.subckt Agl_HSMFC156 1  2  3  4

D_Green  1 2 Agl_HSMGC110
D_Yellow 3 4 Agl_HSMYC110

.MODEL Agl_HSMGC110 D (IS=513.85n RS=89.63 N=1.5 BV=5 IBV=100U
+ CJO=9P VJ=.75 M=.333 TT=4.32U)

.MODEL Agl_HSMYC110 D (IS=513.85n RS=84.63 N=1.5 BV=5 IBV=100U
+ CJO=6P VJ=.75 M=.333 TT=4.32U)

*Temperature and Noise Effects are not Modelled

.ends Agl_HSMFC156
